            "comprehends": [
             "copies/fk960pq3086#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Pencil, treble edge. Six figures grouped 2 + 2 + 2 with a closing period. The crop cuts the tops of the figures at the panel edge, but each is traceable: two plain carets for the 1s, a bowl with a descender for the 9, plain loops for the 0s."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
